<title>USA: Eskimo sees '97 EPS from $0.36 to $0.80.</title>
<headline>Eskimo sees '97 EPS from $0.36 to $0.80.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eskimo Pie Corp said on Thursday it expected its 1997 net income per share to fall to between $0.36 and $0.80, most likely &quot;towards the middle&quot; of that range.</p>
<p>With the company concentrating its advertising on the early part of the year, it expects that &quot;substantially all&quot; of its earnings will occur in the second and third quarters.</p>
<p>Eskimo Pie makes frozen-food products.</p>
</text>
